  "body": "In our current tests, we verify the following:\r\noffscreenCanvas.width = 100;\r\noffscreencanvas.width=\"\";\r\nassert_equal(offscreenCanvas.width, 100)\r\n\r\nsource code: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/offscreen-canvas/the-offscreen-canvas/size.attributes.parse.empty.html\r\n\r\nWhen I read the spec for offscreencanvas, it seems that EnforceRange should map empty string/space only string to 0. Could you some confirm that what' the expected behavior?\r\n\r\nThank you so much ",
